  "task_assistant_messages": [
    "Under the standard overtime rule, qualifying overtime is paid at **time-and-a-half**:\n\n\\[\n\\text{Overtime multiplier}=1.5\\times\n\\]\n\nFor Mark’s former $11/hour wage, that would be:\n\n\\[\n11 \\times 1.5=\\$16.50\\text{/hour}\n\\]\n\nWeekend work is not automatically overtime unless it causes him to exceed the applicable weekly hours threshold or an employer policy provides otherwise.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{1.5\\times}\n\\]",
    "The overtime **multiplier remains \\(1.5\\times\\)**. With Mark’s corrected base wage:\n\n\\[\n\\$10 \\times 1.5 = \\$15\n\\]\n\nSo Mark would earn **$15 per overtime hour**.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{1.5\\times}\n\\]",
